# crawl4ai-project environment file.
#
# Honest note: the current code does NOT read anything from this file - there is
# no python-dotenv / os.getenv("PROXY_URL") usage in crawl_api.py or
# maps_scraper.py. It exists for parity with the 2026-09-09 machine, where
# PROXY_URL held a DataImpulse proxy credential (the value is intentionally NOT
# committed to this repo).
#
# If you later wire proxy support into the crawler, put the credential here and
# load it with python-dotenv.
#
# PROXY_URL="http://USER:PASS@gw.dataimpulse.com:823"
PROXY_URL=
